  "term": "spike-wave activity",
  "definition": "Spike-wave activity is a pattern of brain electrical activity discussed here in relation to absence seizures. In this source, prolonged spike-wave activity is linked with absence status epilepticus and a distinct behavioral state between sedation and wakefulness.",
